     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br>I am experimenting with Tipping &amp; Bishop&#39;s PPCA model. However, two versions I tried in Stan seem slow. Is there better way to write an efficient PPCA model?<br>Thanks!<br>Lei<br><br><font size=\"4\">PPCA version 1:</font><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">              </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// num datapoints</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> D</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">              </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// num dimension</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> K</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">              </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// num basis</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  real</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sigma1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">//real&lt;lower=0&gt; sigma2;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  real</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sigma3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  real</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sigma4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">      <br>  real y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">D</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>transformed data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">K</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">K</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sigma</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">D</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">D</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sigma2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">K</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> diag_elem</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">K</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> zr_vec</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">D</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> diag_elem2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">D</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> zr_vec2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">k </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">K</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> zr_vec</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">k</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">k </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">K</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> diag_elem</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">k</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sigma3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sigma</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> diag_matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">diag_elem</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">d </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">D</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> zr_vec2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">d</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">d </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">D</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> diag_elem2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">d</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sigma1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sigma2</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> diag_matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">diag_elem2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>parameters </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">K</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">D</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">            </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// basis</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">K</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\">           </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// coefficients</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>model </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">//vector[K] x[N];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> multi_normal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">zr_vec</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sigma</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">k </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">K</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    A</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">k</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> multi_normal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">zr_vec2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sigma2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=